{
  "name": "pairwise_advantage_loss",
  "intuition": "Simplified the code by removing the invalid line continuation character. The loss computes the difference between advantages for winning and losing samples, scales it, applies logsigmoid to stabilize numerical computations and map to (0,1), then averages and negates for gradient ascent on preference. The core logic is preserved and syntax errors fixed.",
